(5501776, 793955, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I like the subtle lighting.  Too bad it wasn''t advanced editing.  I wonder if you did a selective color adjustment and brought up the black a bit, if that would have "removed" the specks on the background.</td>', 'Very nice.  I like the subtle lighting.  Too bad it wasn''t advanced editing.  I wonder if you did a selective color adjustment and brought up the black a bit, if that would have "removed" the specks on the background.', '2009-05-27 10:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5501777, 793724, 48043, '<td valign="top">Are live plants considered still life? When shooting flowers, you really need pristine specimens. Two petals look half deadalthough this may be the proper shape, I don''t know. The rule of thirds may have improved composition.</td>', 'Are live plants considered still life? When shooting flowers, you really need pristine specimens. Two petals look half deadalthough this may be the proper shape, I don''t know. The rule of thirds may have improved composition.', '2009-05-27 10:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5501782, 793930, 15711, '<td valign="top">This has an old masters feel to it.  I might''ve had more negative space to one side.  Just my taste. :~)</td>', 'This has an old masters feel to it.  I might''ve had more negative space to one side.  Just my taste. :~)', '2009-05-27 10:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5501783, 793930, 57447, '<td valign="top">Beautiful still life quality, but I can''t really make out the object in the bacground.  I need to calibrate my glasses!</td>', 'Beautiful still life quality, but I can''t really make out the object in the bacground.  I need to calibrate my glasses!', '2009-05-27 10:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5501784, 792917, 97475, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, but for who is the third ring???</td>', 'Beautiful shot, but for who is the third ring???', '2009-05-27 10:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5501785, 793537, 15711, '<td valign="top">I feel like this would have presented itself better using more negative space to one side, perhaps in landscape orientation.</td>', 'I feel like this would have presented itself better using more negative space to one side, perhaps in landscape orientation.', '2009-05-27 10:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5501788, 792924, 97475, '<td valign="top">A very good macro.</td>', 'A very good macro.', '2009-05-27 10:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5501789, 793933, 48043, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you''ll get a lot of, "the bottle is distorted." You''ve cut the bottle holder and the picture; it doesn''t look like a complete picture to me. Ask yourself, would someone pain this exactly as you''ve shot it?</td>', 'I''m sure you''ll get a lot of, "the bottle is distorted." You''ve cut the bottle holder and the picture; it doesn''t look like a complete picture to me. Ask yourself, would someone pain this exactly as you''ve shot it?', '2009-05-27 10:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5501790, 793549, 15711, '<td valign="top">A still life is generally an image of one or more inanimate objects. :~)</td>', 'A still life is generally an image of one or more inanimate objects. :~)', '2009-05-27 10:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5501793, 793911, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting a lot.  It feels too boxed in.  Perhaps panning back with more negative space to one side would have given it more impact for me.</td>', 'I like the lighting a lot.  It feels too boxed in.  Perhaps panning back with more negative space to one side would have given it more impact for me.', '2009-05-27 10:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5501795, 793888, 48043, '<td valign="top">Please take this photo before you eat next time. The muck on the sides of the little bowl looks yuck. Nice composition though. The lines guide your eyes from one side of the picture to the other.</td>', 'Please take this photo before you eat next time. The muck on the sides of the little bowl looks yuck. Nice composition though. The lines guide your eyes from one side of the picture to the other.', '2009-05-27 10:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
