(5501802, 793618, 48043, '<td valign="top">Why dead flowers, I don''t get it. Maybe with a black depression background it would have worked better. The pot looks a tad crooked.</td>', 'Why dead flowers, I don''t get it. Maybe with a black depression background it would have worked better. The pot looks a tad crooked.', '2009-05-27 10:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
