(5501835, 793521, 48043, '<td valign="top">I''m personally sick of these glass shots; they''re becoming cliché. But I won''t mark you down for it.</td>', 'I''m personally sick of these glass shots; they''re becoming cliché. But I won''t mark you down for it.', '2009-05-27 10:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5501837, 793804, 43774, '<td valign="top">The setup is good, as is the lighting. Not so sure about the angle you took it from, would like to see a slightly higher perspective.</td>', 'The setup is good, as is the lighting. Not so sure about the angle you took it from, would like to see a slightly higher perspective.', '2009-05-27 10:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5501840, 793073, 88613, '<td valign="top">I like it!</td>', 'I like it!', '2009-05-27 10:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5501841, 793133, 43774, '<td valign="top">This looks slightly tilted. It''s a nice setup with charm.</td>', 'This looks slightly tilted. It''s a nice setup with charm.', '2009-05-27 10:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5501842, 792907, 43774, '<td valign="top">Have you flipped the photo? That''s what it looks like to me, good job.</td>', 'Have you flipped the photo? That''s what it looks like to me, good job.', '2009-05-27 10:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5501843, 792927, 48043, '<td valign="top">The lines of the table seem to draw you away from the subject. The other dead stuff on the table is distracting. I personally prefer live pristine flowers. Nice try though, keep it up.</td>', 'The lines of the table seem to draw you away from the subject. The other dead stuff on the table is distracting. I personally prefer live pristine flowers. Nice try though, keep it up.', '2009-05-27 10:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5501844, 793942, 51269, '<td valign="top">How naughty &amp; cute- what kind of mind produced this great image -hmmmm- 10 !</td>', 'How naughty & cute- what kind of mind produced this great image -hmmmm- 10 !', '2009-05-27 10:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5501845, 793863, 97475, '<td valign="top">I think your flash is well seen on the wall (the brighter part of the wall).</td>', 'I think your flash is well seen on the wall (the brighter part of the wall).', '2009-05-27 10:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5501846, 793956, 48043, '<td valign="top">Love the contrasting black back with white foreground. The colour of the ringsyou main subjectis a bit pale though.</td>', 'Love the contrasting black back with white foreground. The colour of the ringsyou main subjectis a bit pale though.', '2009-05-27 10:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5501849, 793816, 48043, '<td valign="top">The picture seems a bit too manufactured given a candle is used under such a bright light.</td>', 'The picture seems a bit too manufactured given a candle is used under such a bright light.', '2009-05-27 10:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5501851, 793929, 48043, '<td valign="top">Funny picture. The shadow from the flash is a harsh.</td>', 'Funny picture. The shadow from the flash is a harsh.', '2009-05-27 10:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5501853, 793537, 97475, '<td valign="top">The photo looks too dark.</td>', 'The photo looks too dark.', '2009-05-27 10:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5501854, 793100, 48043, '<td valign="top">Lacking something, but not sure what. Maybe a slightly lower angle would have made this more interesting.</td>', 'Lacking something, but not sure what. Maybe a slightly lower angle would have made this more interesting.', '2009-05-27 10:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5501855, 793353, 97475, '<td valign="top">The lighting is too strong.</td>', 'The lighting is too strong.', '2009-05-27 10:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5501856, 793857, 43774, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I like the red background. It''s sort of out of place with the old coffee pot and wooden grinder. But a good setup.</td>', 'I''m not sure I like the red background. It''s sort of out of place with the old coffee pot and wooden grinder. But a good setup.', '2009-05-27 10:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5501858, 793928, 43774, '<td valign="top">Good DOF, a good still life.</td>', 'Good DOF, a good still life.', '2009-05-27 10:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5501859, 793804, 97475, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting.</td>', 'Nice lighting.', '2009-05-27 10:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5501860, 793847, 43774, '<td valign="top">A good clear photo but a bit busy for my tastes.</td>', 'A good clear photo but a bit busy for my tastes.', '2009-05-27 10:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5501863, 792983, 43774, '<td valign="top">Not so sure I like the tight crop at the top.....I''d rather the focal point be the flowers themselves and not the stems or vase. But a very clear photo, good colours.</td>', 'Not so sure I like the tight crop at the top.....I''d rather the focal point be the flowers themselves and not the stems or vase. But a very clear photo, good colours.', '2009-05-27 10:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5501864, 793560, 43774, '<td valign="top">Good colour, nice reflections, a solid photo.</td>', 'Good colour, nice reflections, a solid photo.', '2009-05-27 10:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5501865, 793099, 43774, '<td valign="top">The background is competing with the subject matter for attention. Other than that it''s a good photo.</td>', 'The background is competing with the subject matter for attention. Other than that it''s a good photo.', '2009-05-27 10:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5501869, 793871, 48043, '<td valign="top">If you want a good score, you need to take more care with the placement of the pencils; more perfect symmetry. The eyewhere everything is pointing to, your main subjectdoesn''t seem to have the best focus. The pencils focus is good.</td>', 'If you want a good score, you need to take more care with the placement of the pencils; more perfect symmetry. The eyewhere everything is pointing to, your main subjectdoesn''t seem to have the best focus. The pencils focus is good.', '2009-05-27 10:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5501870, 793714, 43774, '<td valign="top">I like the setup but wish it were a tiny bit brighter. Lots of good detail and I like the subtle colours. Not sure you needed the moving tree branch (or whatever it is) in there.</td>', 'I like the setup but wish it were a tiny bit brighter. Lots of good detail and I like the subtle colours. Not sure you needed the moving tree branch (or whatever it is) in there.', '2009-05-27 10:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5501872, 793607, 48043, '<td valign="top">Romantic, yet creepy! What does the title mean?</td>', 'Romantic, yet creepy! What does the title mean?', '2009-05-27 10:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5501873, 793521, 43774, '<td valign="top">I expected a few shots like this in the challenge. I have nothing against them but this one seems a bit too busy and crowded. Could also be a bit brighter I think. But congrats on getting the reflections with no strong reflections from your light source.</td>', 'I expected a few shots like this in the challenge. I have nothing against them but this one seems a bit too busy and crowded. Could also be a bit brighter I think. But congrats on getting the reflections with no strong reflections from your light source.', '2009-05-27 10:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5501874, 793748, 48043, '<td valign="top">The line of the cannon draws me to the end of the cannon, which is obstructed!</td>', 'The line of the cannon draws me to the end of the cannon, which is obstructed!', '2009-05-27 10:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5501875, 793359, 43774, '<td valign="top">Painting with light? A good idea but I''m not sure if it works, the objects seem too far away from each other, it just doesn''t flow for me. But good luck!</td>', 'Painting with light? A good idea but I''m not sure if it works, the objects seem too far away from each other, it just doesn''t flow for me. But good luck!', '2009-05-27 10:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5501877, 793956, 43774, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting, not too harsh or bright. A classic photo that any bride &amp; groom would love.</td>', 'Excellent lighting, not too harsh or bright. A classic photo that any bride & groom would love.', '2009-05-27 10:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5501878, 793524, 48043, '<td valign="top">Composition, lighting, clarity all very good.</td>', 'Composition, lighting, clarity all very good.', '2009-05-27 10:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5501880, 792841, 48043, '<td valign="top">Good composition, but focus is soft.</td>', 'Good composition, but focus is soft.', '2009-05-27 10:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5501881, 793965, 43774, '<td valign="top">A bit too busy for me, I would concentrate on the dried and dying flowers and get rid of all the distractions. Good lighting.</td>', 'A bit too busy for me, I would concentrate on the dried and dying flowers and get rid of all the distractions. Good lighting.', '2009-05-27 10:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5501882, 793795, 97475, '<td valign="top">Nicely photographed.</td>', 'Nicely photographed.', '2009-05-27 10:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5501883, 793326, 43774, '<td valign="top">A very good food photo, well done.</td>', 'A very good food photo, well done.', '2009-05-27 10:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
