(5503912, 793753, 105171, '<td valign="top">Seems to lack focus.</td>', 'Seems to lack focus.', '2009-05-28 15:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5503915, 793618, 105171, '<td valign="top">The background is too distracting.  An increased DOF would have produced a better image.</td>', 'The background is too distracting.  An increased DOF would have produced a better image.', '2009-05-28 15:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5503916, 792414, 105171, '<td valign="top">Seems to lack focus and bit too much contrast / lighting.</td>', 'Seems to lack focus and bit too much contrast / lighting.', '2009-05-28 15:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5503917, 793359, 105171, '<td valign="top">Seems to lack focus.</td>', 'Seems to lack focus.', '2009-05-28 15:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5503918, 793151, 105171, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  Hard to capture a still humming bird, but not sure whether this photo meets the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice shot.  Hard to capture a still humming bird, but not sure whether this photo meets the challenge.', '2009-05-28 16:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5503944, 793577, 61788, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Not sure why you decided to have part of reflection so close to border. From my point of view, graphics (lines and shapes) are very important in this image and from that perspective line almost touching border is not that good.</td>', 'Very nice. Not sure why you decided to have part of reflection so close to border. From my point of view, graphics (lines and shapes) are very important in this image and from that perspective line almost touching border is not that good.', '2009-05-28 16:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5504114, 793099, 61788, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of reflective whatever - distorted reflections draw attention. I wonder how this will look as black and white - for some reason I''m not that comfortable with combination of colors here - even though there are not that many :)</td>', 'Interesting use of reflective whatever - distorted reflections draw attention. I wonder how this will look as black and white - for some reason I''m not that comfortable with combination of colors here - even though there are not that many :)', '2009-05-28 20:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5504127, 793787, 61788, '<td valign="top">I like colors here, and textures of background and pear - kind of contrasting. Reflective surface doesn''t look really attractive. Problem here is not that I would prefer "mirror like" clear reflection - it would make this similar to many other images. However I feel this surface should have had either more apparent features, or be closer to mirror having less dots or whatever is there. And I like that horizon is tilted - it goes well with this image.</td>', 'I like colors here, and textures of background and pear - kind of contrasting. Reflective surface doesn''t look really attractive. Problem here is not that I would prefer "mirror like" clear reflection - it would make this similar to many other images. However I feel this surface should have had either more apparent features, or be closer to mirror having less dots or whatever is there. And I like that horizon is tilted - it goes well with this image.', '2009-05-28 20:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5504137, 793848, 57447, '<td valign="top">Could use a little more depth but I like the composition.</td>', 'Could use a little more depth but I like the composition.', '2009-05-28 21:01:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5504139, 793623, 57447, '<td valign="top">Intresting objects chosen for your still life.</td>', 'Intresting objects chosen for your still life.', '2009-05-28 21:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5504140, 793718, 57447, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective.</td>', 'Nice perspective.', '2009-05-28 21:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5504141, 793764, 57447, '<td valign="top">Great macro, I would like to see one or two more objects in your still life.</td>', 'Great macro, I would like to see one or two more objects in your still life.', '2009-05-28 21:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5504142, 793642, 57447, '<td valign="top">Nice set up, I would like to see the colors a bit more saturated.</td>', 'Nice set up, I would like to see the colors a bit more saturated.', '2009-05-28 21:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5504219, 793321, 57447, '<td valign="top">Nice composition &amp; color.</td>', 'Nice composition & color.', '2009-05-28 23:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5504221, 792382, 57447, '<td valign="top">Nice background.</td>', 'Nice background.', '2009-05-28 23:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5504222, 793495, 57447, '<td valign="top">Interesting bokeh, is not such a traditional still life to me.</td>', 'Interesting bokeh, is not such a traditional still life to me.', '2009-05-28 23:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5504351, 793689, 61788, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition. Background controlled well (excluding brightest part on right side). It seems like little bit darker whites may look better. I think intesnsity of color of vase somewhat takes away from beauty of flowers. Currently vase is maybe equally important element of image. I would prefer it was secondary. Outside of challenge, I would have desaturated it to some degree. Could work as black and white too, but desaturation would be better option. Good work.</td>', 'Very nice composition. Background controlled well (excluding brightest part on right side). It seems like little bit darker whites may look better. I think intesnsity of color of vase somewhat takes away from beauty of flowers. Currently vase is maybe equally important element of image. I would prefer it was secondary. Outside of challenge, I would have desaturated it to some degree. Could work as black and white too, but desaturation would be better option. Good work.', '2009-05-29 03:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5504353, 793804, 41337, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting on the grapes. The bottle would look better without the room reflection.</td>', 'Love the lighting on the grapes. The bottle would look better without the room reflection.', '2009-05-29 03:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5504356, 793607, 61788, '<td valign="top">Interesting work! We used to see so often batterflies on flowers - all alive and colorful. This breaks that standard and I consider it very original. Choice of monochrome is very appropriate. I wish floweres were little bit larger or maybe part around butterfly darker - to focus more attention to flowers - away from butterfly that is currently dominating object. Very good work anyway.</td>', 'Interesting work! We used to see so often batterflies on flowers - all alive and colorful. This breaks that standard and I consider it very original. Choice of monochrome is very appropriate. I wish floweres were little bit larger or maybe part around butterfly darker - to focus more attention to flowers - away from butterfly that is currently dominating object. Very good work anyway.', '2009-05-29 03:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5504363, 793897, 61788, '<td valign="top">Choice of colors is unusual and good, but I think composition needs something - other object? different color element? beam of light? - something that can kind of anchor attention.</td>', 'Choice of colors is unusual and good, but I think composition needs something - other object? different color element? beam of light? - something that can kind of anchor attention.', '2009-05-29 04:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5504373, 793714, 31637, '<td valign="top">A bit under-exposed, for me at least, but still very nice</td>', 'A bit under-exposed, for me at least, but still very nice', '2009-05-29 04:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5504374, 793582, 31637, '<td valign="top">Hmm...very nice, but a tease almost. I would like to see more of the wall and window, just a little more of a wider frame would work for me...6</td>', 'Hmm...very nice, but a tease almost. I would like to see more of the wall and window, just a little more of a wider frame would work for me...6', '2009-05-29 04:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5504375, 793888, 31637, '<td valign="top">Zucchini and vinegar! YES! well framed too.</td>', 'Zucchini and vinegar! YES! well framed too.', '2009-05-29 04:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5504385, 793099, 102519, '<td valign="top">nice but why you crop the pear on the right like this?</td>', 'nice but why you crop the pear on the right like this?', '2009-05-29 05:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5504386, 793929, 102519, '<td valign="top">Sorry but there is just a lot wrong with this image, lighting, subjects, composition etc</td>', 'Sorry but there is just a lot wrong with this image, lighting, subjects, composition etc', '2009-05-29 05:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5504387, 792738, 102519, '<td valign="top">Beautiful the only thing i dont like to much is the long shadow fropm the roses on the music</td>', 'Beautiful the only thing i dont like to much is the long shadow fropm the roses on the music', '2009-05-29 05:18:10.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5504388, 793754, 102519, '<td valign="top">nice and simple but very well done, i like it!</td>', 'nice and simple but very well done, i like it!', '2009-05-29 05:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5504390, 793804, 102519, '<td valign="top">nice well done, i like everthing, expecially the light and the grapes, only minor is te reflections in the bottle of wine, i can see everything in the room in nit</td>', 'nice well done, i like everthing, expecially the light and the grapes, only minor is te reflections in the bottle of wine, i can see everything in the room in nit', '2009-05-29 05:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5504399, 793764, 102519, '<td valign="top">excellent colors and light and nicely framed!</td>', 'excellent colors and light and nicely framed!', '2009-05-29 06:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5504400, 792917, 44825, '<td valign="top">I like this photo. My only comment would be to turn the invitation around so that it could be read</td>', 'I like this photo. My only comment would be to turn the invitation around so that it could be read', '2009-05-29 06:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5504401, 792902, 44825, '<td valign="top">This is an OK shot. I like the layout and balance of the subject and they are well lit. IMO the problem is with the tomatoes themselves. Although vibrant with colour, they appear to have a matte finish. One good trick I have used is to wipe them with an oil (probably Olive oil)and they become much more reflective. You could at that stage also spray them with water to give them that just picked look.</td>', 'This is an OK shot. I like the layout and balance of the subject and they are well lit. IMO the problem is with the tomatoes themselves. Although vibrant with colour, they appear to have a matte finish. One good trick I have used is to wipe them with an oil (probably Olive oil)and they become much more reflective. You could at that stage also spray them with water to give them that just picked look.', '2009-05-29 06:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5504403, 793565, 44825, '<td valign="top">I like the layout but would question the sepia toning. IMO The different colours of the fruits would have helped this shot. I am assuming that there are reds, greens and yellows in the fruit which would have been nice to see. Focus and lighting are spot on.</td>', 'I like the layout but would question the sepia toning. IMO The different colours of the fruits would have helped this shot. I am assuming that there are reds, greens and yellows in the fruit which would have been nice to see. Focus and lighting are spot on.', '2009-05-29 06:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5504404, 793353, 44825, '<td valign="top">IMO the lighting is way to harsh for such a delicate subject</td>', 'IMO the lighting is way to harsh for such a delicate subject', '2009-05-29 06:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
