(5505650, 793621, 41675, '<td valign="top">An interesting image. For me though, it''s quite busy and my eyes keep getting pulled to the upper left hand corner thereby "ignoring" the rest of the image. Maybe not "play" in photoshop so much and keep it a more natural looking photo would make your image more appealing to me.</td>', 'An interesting image. For me though, it''s quite busy and my eyes keep getting pulled to the upper left hand corner thereby "ignoring" the rest of the image. Maybe not "play" in photoshop so much and keep it a more natural looking photo would make your image more appealing to me.', '2009-05-30 12:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5505651, 792782, 41675, '<td valign="top">Interesting image. I like the combination. For me though, I wish there was more contrast or perhaps a bit sharper focus. Also, keep in mind to fully utilize the 640 pixel allowance we''re given for entries. Sometimes a larger image of the same photo looks better.</td>', 'Interesting image. I like the combination. For me though, I wish there was more contrast or perhaps a bit sharper focus. Also, keep in mind to fully utilize the 640 pixel allowance we''re given for entries. Sometimes a larger image of the same photo looks better.', '2009-05-30 12:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5505652, 793755, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice close up. that little bit of white/yellow area in the upper left detracts a bit - my eyes keep getting pulled up that way when I look at your image.</td>', 'Nice close up. that little bit of white/yellow area in the upper left detracts a bit - my eyes keep getting pulled up that way when I look at your image.', '2009-05-30 12:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5505653, 793955, 41675, '<td valign="top">Simple yet well executed and great lighting. With that solid black background, this is sure to be a DPC pleaser. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Simple yet well executed and great lighting. With that solid black background, this is sure to be a DPC pleaser. Good luck in the challenge.', '2009-05-30 12:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5505655, 793822, 41675, '<td valign="top">Simple composition yet it works for me. I like the egg holder itself. The spirals lend interest to your image.</td>', 'Simple composition yet it works for me. I like the egg holder itself. The spirals lend interest to your image.', '2009-05-30 12:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5505657, 793386, 41675, '<td valign="top">Interesting. Not sure a live critter technically qualifies for a still life. I like the composition and color contrast.</td>', 'Interesting. Not sure a live critter technically qualifies for a still life. I like the composition and color contrast.', '2009-05-30 12:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5505660, 793878, 41675, '<td valign="top">When I first saw your image I thought of a framed sketch hanging in a bathroom. I like the image, wish it were a bit larger though and not so much frame around it.</td>', 'When I first saw your image I thought of a framed sketch hanging in a bathroom. I like the image, wish it were a bit larger though and not so much frame around it.', '2009-05-30 12:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5505661, 792738, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the composition - the angles, but for me,  I wish it had an overall sharper focus, especially by the violin.</td>', 'I like the composition - the angles, but for me,  I wish it had an overall sharper focus, especially by the violin.', '2009-05-30 12:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5505663, 793804, 41675, '<td valign="top">Well balanced, well lit and composed. Good background and foreground. I hope this does well in the challenge.</td>', 'Well balanced, well lit and composed. Good background and foreground. I hope this does well in the challenge.', '2009-05-30 12:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
