(5505667, 793910, 41675, '<td valign="top">Interesting image. For me, my brain doesn''t like seeing things upside down - at least your photo seems to me like it''s upside down. I like the shadows and light on the tines.</td>', 'Interesting image. For me, my brain doesn''t like seeing things upside down - at least your photo seems to me like it''s upside down. I like the shadows and light on the tines.', '2009-05-30 12:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
