(5505669, 793707, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, your photo might hold my interest longer if you pulled back a bit or took it from a different angle, maybe off-center your main object or add another object for additional interest.</td>', 'For me, your photo might hold my interest longer if you pulled back a bit or took it from a different angle, maybe off-center your main object or add another object for additional interest.', '2009-05-30 12:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
