(5506101, 793818, 31637, '<td valign="top">Interesting meld of subjects.</td>', 'Interesting meld of subjects.', '2009-05-30 21:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5506132, 793928, 77196, '<td valign="top">Not only does this have technical excellence, it has strong emotive impact.</td>', 'Not only does this have technical excellence, it has strong emotive impact.', '2009-05-30 23:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5506139, 793197, 77196, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot. Excellent use of the pitcher &amp; bowl tying into the lemon &amp; limes'' colors. Using a white chair for the "table" all against a red background produces a vibrant, colorful image. Add to that your arrangement of the elements, which adds a lot of interest, and this is just an outstanding shot.</td>', 'I like this a lot. Excellent use of the pitcher & bowl tying into the lemon & limes'' colors. Using a white chair for the "table" all against a red background produces a vibrant, colorful image. Add to that your arrangement of the elements, which adds a lot of interest, and this is just an outstanding shot.', '2009-05-30 23:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5506140, 793933, 77196, '<td valign="top">For me, what gives this shot that "extra punch" is the beautiful lighting on the gold foil on the neck of the bottle that ties into the gold on the frame. Very nicely done.</td>', 'For me, what gives this shot that "extra punch" is the beautiful lighting on the gold foil on the neck of the bottle that ties into the gold on the frame. Very nicely done.', '2009-05-30 23:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5506142, 793973, 77196, '<td valign="top">Too dark for me. I think this could have been lightened a fair amount without losing the mood.</td>', 'Too dark for me. I think this could have been lightened a fair amount without losing the mood.', '2009-05-30 23:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5506143, 793325, 77196, '<td valign="top">That''s not Art. That''s Steve.</td>', 'That''s not Art. That''s Steve.', '2009-05-30 23:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5506146, 793657, 77196, '<td valign="top">The heart formed by the shadow is almost too subtle - almost missed it. This shot is just a bit too much of nothing but a bit too much. I want to like it - nice concept, and well done. Perhaps a crop at the bottom of the heart shadow would get rid of a lot of the extra without taking away the soul of the shot.</td>', 'The heart formed by the shadow is almost too subtle - almost missed it. This shot is just a bit too much of nothing but a bit too much. I want to like it - nice concept, and well done. Perhaps a crop at the bottom of the heart shadow would get rid of a lot of the extra without taking away the soul of the shot.', '2009-05-30 23:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5506150, 792879, 77196, '<td valign="top">You must really believe in making taking a picture a real challenge. This is a tough shot, and - for me - your entered result has some issues. The major one is lack of focus (in two senses - the sharpness of the image, as well as a major focal point to draw the eye). The large dark area in the bottom half draws my attention - because of both its size and location, but there is literally nothing there to see. I do like the contrast of the red and black - on the emotive side, this has strong contrasting elements, where even the positive element (red) is not entirely so. This almost feels like "danger!" or "warning!".</td>', 'You must really believe in making taking a picture a real challenge. This is a tough shot, and - for me - your entered result has some issues. The major one is lack of focus (in two senses - the sharpness of the image, as well as a major focal point to draw the eye). The large dark area in the bottom half draws my attention - because of both its size and location, but there is literally nothing there to see. I do like the contrast of the red and black - on the emotive side, this has strong contrasting elements, where even the positive element (red) is not entirely so. This almost feels like "danger!" or "warning!".', '2009-05-30 23:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5506151, 793531, 77196, '<td valign="top">This feels overprocessed to me. Otherwise, I love the colors and the reflection.</td>', 'This feels overprocessed to me. Otherwise, I love the colors and the reflection.', '2009-05-30 23:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5506152, 793537, 77196, '<td valign="top">Too dark - may just be my monitor. Great idea, though.</td>', 'Too dark - may just be my monitor. Great idea, though.', '2009-05-30 23:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5506154, 793944, 77196, '<td valign="top">Having the foreground shells in as sharp focus as the glass jar mouth would''ve improved this shot for me.</td>', 'Having the foreground shells in as sharp focus as the glass jar mouth would''ve improved this shot for me.', '2009-05-30 23:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5506157, 793572, 62727, '<td valign="top">ROFLOL!  Excellent title!  I like the sepia color and dof.  Good job.</td>', 'ROFLOL!  Excellent title!  I like the sepia color and dof.  Good job.', '2009-05-30 23:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5506158, 793942, 62727, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Some little girl is searching everywhere for her Barbie and Ken dolls!</td>', 'LOL!  Some little girl is searching everywhere for her Barbie and Ken dolls!', '2009-05-30 23:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5506159, 792983, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice foreground in focus, bokah in back. Iris are nicely in focus, and color is gorgeous. However, your shot seems to do everything it can to annoy the viewer by distracting from the primary subject (the flowers). You have a large dead spot in the bottom left 2/3 of the shot. You keep most of the vase in the shot, including the water line, but crop off the top part of the flowers. Just a suggestion, but crop down to just the upper right 1/4 of the picture, and I think you''d find that a much more pleasant picture. It isn''t "wrong" to crop through the flowers, but the balance of the shot makes me want to see more of the flowers in the upper left of the shot.</td>', 'Nice foreground in focus, bokah in back. Iris are nicely in focus, and color is gorgeous. However, your shot seems to do everything it can to annoy the viewer by distracting from the primary subject (the flowers). You have a large dead spot in the bottom left 2/3 of the shot. You keep most of the vase in the shot, including the water line, but crop off the top part of the flowers. Just a suggestion, but crop down to just the upper right 1/4 of the picture, and I think you''d find that a much more pleasant picture. It isn''t "wrong" to crop through the flowers, but the balance of the shot makes me want to see more of the flowers in the upper left of the shot.', '2009-05-30 23:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5506161, 793487, 77196, '<td valign="top">This so does not look real. I know the birds are supposed to give it context for size, but they look fake too. The blues in this shot are wonderful.</td>', 'This so does not look real. I know the birds are supposed to give it context for size, but they look fake too. The blues in this shot are wonderful.', '2009-05-30 23:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5506169, 793880, 77196, '<td valign="top">For me, this is too dark. The glass globe on the lamp seems dirty (especially the top). I so want to like this shot - it has lots of the elements I love, but for me it struggles. Things like cropping the lamp (right side) but not the clock (left edge), the lamp reflector being almost edge-on to the viewer, rather than behind and slightly to the right of the lamp, etc. Even though it seems too dark for me, I do like the uniformity of lighting between the clock and the lamp.</td>', 'For me, this is too dark. The glass globe on the lamp seems dirty (especially the top). I so want to like this shot - it has lots of the elements I love, but for me it struggles. Things like cropping the lamp (right side) but not the clock (left edge), the lamp reflector being almost edge-on to the viewer, rather than behind and slightly to the right of the lamp, etc. Even though it seems too dark for me, I do like the uniformity of lighting between the clock and the lamp.', '2009-05-30 23:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5506173, 793871, 77196, '<td valign="top">Disturbing. Nice arrangement and use of blues.</td>', 'Disturbing. Nice arrangement and use of blues.', '2009-05-30 23:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5506175, 793818, 77196, '<td valign="top">I''m bothered by the feather going across the eye socket on the skull. I like the idea, and the combination of dogeared book, quill, and skull.</td>', 'I''m bothered by the feather going across the eye socket on the skull. I like the idea, and the combination of dogeared book, quill, and skull.', '2009-05-30 23:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5506186, 793820, 12674, '<td valign="top">Visually intriguing in its bizarreness</td>', 'Visually intriguing in its bizarreness', '2009-05-30 23:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5506195, 793537, 106726, '<td valign="top">just a bit too dark for my taste - 6</td>', 'just a bit too dark for my taste - 6', '2009-05-30 23:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5506219, 793973, 106233, '<td valign="top">This is scary...</td>', 'This is scary...', '2009-05-31 00:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5506223, 793565, 106233, '<td valign="top">I think that you should opt between frame the entire bowl and all the fruits, or make something more up close... this intermetiate option dont seem to be the better one...</td>', 'I think that you should opt between frame the entire bowl and all the fruits, or make something more up close... this intermetiate option dont seem to be the better one...', '2009-05-31 00:30:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5506226, 793955, 106233, '<td valign="top">good light!</td>', 'good light!', '2009-05-31 00:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5506315, 793051, 11078, '<td valign="top">This is too busy either one could be good but the composition seems all wrong to me <br/>5</td>', 'This is too busy either one could be good but the composition seems all wrong to me 5', '2009-05-31 03:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5506317, 793621, 107129, '<td valign="top">Is it basic editing?</td>', 'Is it basic editing?', '2009-05-31 04:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5506337, 792625, 60173, '<td valign="top">With the light being yellow, I actually imagine cars whizzing through the intersection.</td>', 'With the light being yellow, I actually imagine cars whizzing through the intersection.', '2009-05-31 06:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5506338, 793795, 60173, '<td valign="top">Very pleasant.</td>', 'Very pleasant.', '2009-05-31 07:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5506378, 793845, 79141, '<td valign="top">clever concept</td>', 'clever concept', '2009-05-31 09:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5506392, 793897, 103142, '<td valign="top">Very, very nice!</td>', 'Very, very nice!', '2009-05-31 10:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5506631, 793537, 75699, '<td valign="top">Beautiful... I think.  Just a touch too dark to see.</td>', 'Beautiful... I think.  Just a touch too dark to see.', '2009-05-31 15:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5506634, 793878, 75699, '<td valign="top">I like the photo a lot, but can''t quite make sense of the off-center framing.  I don''t personally think it''s necessary to have such a large area of white - the photo itself is well-composed to emphasize the fractal nature of the shell.  Without the frame I would have rated it higher - 6.</td>', 'I like the photo a lot, but can''t quite make sense of the off-center framing.  I don''t personally think it''s necessary to have such a large area of white - the photo itself is well-composed to emphasize the fractal nature of the shell.  Without the frame I would have rated it higher - 6.', '2009-05-31 15:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5506635, 793845, 75699, '<td valign="top">I love this - very clever idea!  Perhaps a bit brightly lit.  7</td>', 'I love this - very clever idea!  Perhaps a bit brightly lit.  7', '2009-05-31 15:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5506735, 793057, 47470, '<td valign="top">The shadows are a little distracting.</td>', 'The shadows are a little distracting.', '2009-05-31 17:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5506738, 793607, 47470, '<td valign="top">Nice tones, but it feels like the image is tilted a little to the left.</td>', 'Nice tones, but it feels like the image is tilted a little to the left.', '2009-05-31 17:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5506740, 793099, 47470, '<td valign="top">I love the painterly reflection in the back, but I think the garlic detracts from it.</td>', 'I love the painterly reflection in the back, but I think the garlic detracts from it.', '2009-05-31 17:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5506743, 793911, 47470, '<td valign="top">I wish there was a little more space at the top to bring out the snail.</td>', 'I wish there was a little more space at the top to bring out the snail.', '2009-05-31 17:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5506745, 792879, 47470, '<td valign="top">Just as your title suggests, this image is a little too dark.  It looks like you shot in bright sunlight, so you could have opened the aperture or used a bit longer shutter speed to get some more light.  A pass of Unsharp Mask would also help this photo look a bit more bold.</td>', 'Just as your title suggests, this image is a little too dark.  It looks like you shot in bright sunlight, so you could have opened the aperture or used a bit longer shutter speed to get some more light.  A pass of Unsharp Mask would also help this photo look a bit more bold.', '2009-05-31 17:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5506748, 793353, 47470, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you get the melancholy from the bend of the flowers'' heads, but this is too bright and pretty to be melancholy!</td>', 'I''m sure you get the melancholy from the bend of the flowers'' heads, but this is too bright and pretty to be melancholy!', '2009-05-31 17:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5506751, 793961, 47470, '<td valign="top">Love the simplicity and the pairing of green and purple.</td>', 'Love the simplicity and the pairing of green and purple.', '2009-05-31 17:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5506759, 793813, 47470, '<td valign="top">It''s hard to take pictures of old coins because they are so worn that the images don''t look sharp.  In here, it looks like the top is in focus, but the bottom isn''t.  A smoother background would help keep the emphasis on the subjects.</td>', 'It''s hard to take pictures of old coins because they are so worn that the images don''t look sharp.  In here, it looks like the top is in focus, but the bottom isn''t.  A smoother background would help keep the emphasis on the subjects.', '2009-05-31 17:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5506762, 793386, 47470, '<td valign="top">Strange place to put any kind of animal, but great depth of field!</td>', 'Strange place to put any kind of animal, but great depth of field!', '2009-05-31 17:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5506777, 793820, 47470, '<td valign="top">I think the background is a bit distracting.</td>', 'I think the background is a bit distracting.', '2009-05-31 17:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5506782, 793816, 47470, '<td valign="top">I think the arrangement would have worked better if the bath stuff was more central (therefore more prominent) because when I first looked at the image, I thought the Suave was very out of place until I read the title.  I think the titale would fit better if the bath items were more of a focal point than the flowers.</td>', 'I think the arrangement would have worked better if the bath stuff was more central (therefore more prominent) because when I first looked at the image, I thought the Suave was very out of place until I read the title.  I think the titale would fit better if the bath items were more of a focal point than the flowers.', '2009-05-31 17:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5506784, 793133, 47470, '<td valign="top">The lighting is so pretty, but the dust on the floor kills me : )</td>', 'The lighting is so pretty, but the dust on the floor kills me : )', '2009-05-31 17:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5506786, 793197, 47470, '<td valign="top">I like the space above the chair, but the slight cutoff of the fruit bowl keeps catching my eye.  I love the choice of the red background.</td>', 'I like the space above the chair, but the slight cutoff of the fruit bowl keeps catching my eye.  I love the choice of the red background.', '2009-05-31 17:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5506795, 793618, 47470, '<td valign="top">If you pulled the lace back a bit, then blurred it out, it would have given lovely mottled tones.  I wonder what this looks like in BnW or sepia.</td>', 'If you pulled the lace back a bit, then blurred it out, it would have given lovely mottled tones.  I wonder what this looks like in BnW or sepia.', '2009-05-31 17:34:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5506796, 792738, 47470, '<td valign="top">I wish the violin was in focus too.</td>', 'I wish the violin was in focus too.', '2009-05-31 17:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5506803, 793973, 47470, '<td valign="top">This image is pretty underexposed.  If you were going for a creepy feel, you could have made the lighting come from a bit more over the dolls heads so that you could expose properly while keeping the mood.</td>', 'This image is pretty underexposed.  If you were going for a creepy feel, you could have made the lighting come from a bit more over the dolls heads so that you could expose properly while keeping the mood.', '2009-05-31 17:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5506809, 793804, 47470, '<td valign="top">Pretty lighting.  I wish you had used the same material on the table as the background.  The reflection on the right of the bottle is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Pretty lighting.  I wish you had used the same material on the table as the background.  The reflection on the right of the bottle is a bit distracting.', '2009-05-31 17:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5506813, 793942, 47470, '<td valign="top">Haha!  Great find on that pepper!</td>', 'Haha!  Great find on that pepper!', '2009-05-31 17:40:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5506815, 792838, 47470, '<td valign="top">I wanted to do this to my phone last night too.  Great color in the fire.</td>', 'I wanted to do this to my phone last night too.  Great color in the fire.', '2009-05-31 17:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5506816, 793966, 47470, '<td valign="top">I find myself wanting to see the two flowers going out of the frame.</td>', 'I find myself wanting to see the two flowers going out of the frame.', '2009-05-31 17:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5506818, 793930, 47470, '<td valign="top">I think this might be a little dark for my taste.</td>', 'I think this might be a little dark for my taste.', '2009-05-31 17:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5506821, 793604, 47470, '<td valign="top">I love the old feeling of this picture!  It reminds me of what you''d find in an old Italian grandmother''s basement!  The lighting is perfect for the scene and I love the detail.  The only thing I don''t like is the black thing in the bottom left.</td>', 'I love the old feeling of this picture!  It reminds me of what you''d find in an old Italian grandmother''s basement!  The lighting is perfect for the scene and I love the detail.  The only thing I don''t like is the black thing in the bottom left.', '2009-05-31 17:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5506878, 793582, 39833, '<td valign="top">you mean "divine"? good shot, anyway.</td>', 'you mean "divine"? good shot, anyway.', '2009-05-31 18:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5506882, 793955, 39833, '<td valign="top">great shot! 10 from me.</td>', 'great shot! 10 from me.', '2009-05-31 18:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
