(5508872, 792782, 104955, '<td valign="top">Getting that spider to help set this up must''ve been a long wait. I love impromptu shots.</td>', 'Getting that spider to help set this up must''ve been a long wait. I love impromptu shots.', '2009-06-01 20:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5508874, 792924, 104955, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Sometimes simple is better.</td>', 'Very nice. Sometimes simple is better.', '2009-06-01 20:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5509029, 793818, 78371, '<td valign="top">The title is very accurate.  As interesting as the book is, the addition of the feather and skull was a good choice.  However, IMHO, the quill is a bit misplaced. It is a bit visually awkward over half the skull.</td>', 'The title is very accurate.  As interesting as the book is, the addition of the feather and skull was a good choice.  However, IMHO, the quill is a bit misplaced. It is a bit visually awkward over half the skull.', '2009-06-01 22:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5509298, 793754, 107364, '<td valign="top">the lighting and concept is perfect!</td>', 'the lighting and concept is perfect!', '2009-06-02 00:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5509447, 793553, 106473, '<td valign="top">I think you''ve got some really interesting subject matter in here, and the shot is well composed, but I think the lighting is really hurting this picture. There''s a visible light source, but then there''s these really harsh shadows which are clearly coming from a spot light off-camera. If you still have this set up available to you, I''d be really interested to see what it''d look like using just the light from the candle and a longer exposure time. I think it might really bring out some of the interesting textures on the typewriter and leather cover which are being lost to shadow or washed out from the harsh light.</td>', 'I think you''ve got some really interesting subject matter in here, and the shot is well composed, but I think the lighting is really hurting this picture. There''s a visible light source, but then there''s these really harsh shadows which are clearly coming from a spot light off-camera. If you still have this set up available to you, I''d be really interested to see what it''d look like using just the light from the candle and a longer exposure time. I think it might really bring out some of the interesting textures on the typewriter and leather cover which are being lost to shadow or washed out from the harsh light.', '2009-06-02 01:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5509953, 793948, 25036, '<td valign="top">I like this - nice choice for a B&amp;W</td>', 'I like this - nice choice for a B&W', '2009-06-02 10:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5509957, 793944, 25036, '<td valign="top">Nice arrangement of shells - I''m not a big fan of the BG colour nor the frame. Also, the quality of the image seems low - might be oversharpened.</td>', 'Nice arrangement of shells - I''m not a big fan of the BG colour nor the frame. Also, the quality of the image seems low - might be oversharpened.', '2009-06-02 10:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
