(5510251, 793795, 67258, '<td valign="top">This is very pretty, and just what I envision when I produce a still life in my head - I have yet to put any of my vision into practice though! I love the touch the out of focus background bottle gives - the only thing I would change might be the vertical crease in the backdrop.  All in all, lovely.  Bumping - in my top 3.</td>', 'This is very pretty, and just what I envision when I produce a still life in my head - I have yet to put any of my vision into practice though! I love the touch the out of focus background bottle gives - the only thing I would change might be the vertical crease in the backdrop.  All in all, lovely.  Bumping - in my top 3.', '2009-06-02 14:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5510255, 793470, 67258, '<td valign="top">This is so well done - my favourite of the challenge.</td>', 'This is so well done - my favourite of the challenge.', '2009-06-02 14:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5510258, 793902, 67258, '<td valign="top">Inspiration courtesy of Tracy Emin?  Cool - and valid - take on the challenge, and really rather well done.</td>', 'Inspiration courtesy of Tracy Emin?  Cool - and valid - take on the challenge, and really rather well done.', '2009-06-02 14:07:05.000000', NULL, 1);
