(5511172, 793495, 50695, '<td valign="top">I see this as a reaction to the challenge, rather than a meeting of the challenge. It is a stubborn decision to force stillness from a living scene. Sheer madness with a razor plane of sanity translated into a few bars of Still Life... I know that tune... Posthumous Red Ribbon.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg"/></td>', 'I see this as a reaction to the challenge, rather than a meeting of the challenge. It is a stubborn decision to force stillness from a living scene. Sheer madness with a razor plane of sanity translated into a few bars of Still Life... I know that tune... Posthumous Red Ribbon. ', '2009-06-02 23:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
