(5512399, 793073, 77925, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Debbi:</b></div><hr/><i> I''d love to see a setup shot on this</i></td></tr></table> <br/>The setup is pretty straight-forward:<br/>-Forks and egg on edge of the table on a glass plate (tried to get some reflections, but that didn''t work out too well)<br/>-One SB-900 really close in front and below on 1/128 power<br/>-One SB-600 behind lighting the wall on 1/32 power (I think)<br/> <br/>You can see the SB-900 on the original:<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=796441" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/75000-79999/77925/120/796441.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/75000-79999/77925/120/796441.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/75000-79999/77925/120/796441.jpg"/></a> <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by Debbi: I''d love to see a setup shot on this The setup is pretty straight-forward:-Forks and egg on edge of the table on a glass plate (tried to get some reflections, but that didn''t work out too well)-One SB-900 really close in front and below on 1/128 power-One SB-600 behind lighting the wall on 1/32 power (I think) You can see the SB-900 on the original: ', '2009-06-03 15:07:38.000000', NULL, 0),
