(5522889, 793601, 82985, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=677021" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg"/></a>PostLuminous Award Nominee!<br/>this is "still" in the mood of quiet peacefulness it creates....  the small motion the water causes this stillness of mind</td>', 'PostLuminous Award Nominee!this is "still" in the mood of quiet peacefulness it creates....  the small motion the water causes this stillness of mind', '2009-06-10 15:21:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(5522891, 793495, 82985, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=677020" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677020.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677020.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677020.jpg"/></a>PostLuminous Award WINNER!<br/> <br/>I get it.  <br/> <br/>Thanks for sharing this. got a 9 from me.</td>', 'PostLuminous Award WINNER! I get it.   Thanks for sharing this. got a 9 from me.', '2009-06-10 15:23:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(5551120, 792738, 105764, '<td valign="top">Thanks all for the comments!  <br/>I did have a picture exactly like this where the depth of field was correct and the viola is in focus...  but I edited and uploaded the worse version where the viola was out of focus!!!   <br/>I''ve just started out with photography, especially this branch where things are preemptively set up for the photo so hopefully I can improve in the future.<br/> <br/>Thanks Again Commenters, it''s greatly appreciated having your feedback!</td>', 'Thanks all for the comments!  I did have a picture exactly like this where the depth of field was correct and the viola is in focus...  but I edited and uploaded the worse version where the viola was out of focus!!!   I''ve just started out with photography, especially this branch where things are preemptively set up for the photo so hopefully I can improve in the future. Thanks Again Commenters, it''s greatly appreciated having your feedback!', '2009-06-30 15:04:21.000000', NULL, 0),
